  "justification": "The row for specials S5-S16 (Picture Drama 1-12) at offset -16 sent them to season 0 episodes -11 to 0, nowhere. TVDB 357019 lists the first series' picture dramas as season 0 episodes 22-34, Series 1 Picture Drama Episode 1-13; AniDB has twelve of them, all on TVDB's dates: S5-S12 (2019-07-08 to 09-02) = episodes 22-29, S13-S16 (2019-09-16 to 10-07) = episodes 31-34, skipping episode 30 (2019-09-09), which AniDB lacks. S1-S4 stay on episodes 1-4. S17, an undated Picture Drama 13, is not proven to be episode 30, and its default was episode 17, a second-series drama. TMDB 86034 season 0: E15 Yue's Diary (2019-12-25) = S2, E16 Hot Love Springs Eternal (2020-02-26) = S3, E17 Prologue (2020-03-19) = S4, E2-E9 Picture Drama 1.1-1.8 (2019-07-08 to 09-02) = S5-S12 by date, and E11-E14 Picture Drama 1.10-1.13 (2019-09-16 to 10-07) = S13-S16 by date: AniDB has no picture drama for TMDB's 1.9 (2019-09-09), the same gap as on TVDB, and its undated S17 has no TMDB episode. With no TMDB row S2-S17 took E2-E17.",
